<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προετικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προΐημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>emitting
				easily,</i> in 
				Comp.
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθεκτικώτερος</span>
			(more retentive), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				963a21
			</span></i>; <i>emitting,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρέος [ἤχου</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				89.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>apt to throw away, profuse, lavish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1120b15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δαπάνης</span>
			<i>lavish</i> of expense, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Def.</u>
				416b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>VV</u>
					1250b25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινί</span>
			<i>giving lavishly</i> to . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1367b6
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>EN</u>
					1122b8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
